    {
      "id": "c8b98118c4b56666",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 2420,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 650,
      "text": "## 跨公司关系索引\n\n**PX51** · TSMC → Apple\nTSMC 先进节点支撑 Apple silicon 代工\n\n**PX52** · TSMC → NVIDIA\nTSMC 先进封装支撑 NVIDIA AI 加速器\n\n**PX53** · SK Hynix → NVIDIA\nHBM 支撑 NVIDIA AI 加速器内存带宽\n\n**PX54** · Samsung Electronics → Apple\nSamsung 存储组件与 Apple 终端供应基线\n\n**PX55** · Samsung Electronics → Apple\nSamsung OLED 与 Apple 终端显示供应基线\n\n**PX56** · NVIDIA → Amazon / AWS\nNVIDIA GPU 支撑 AWS AI 基础设施\n\n**PX57** · NVIDIA → Microsoft\nNVIDIA GPU 支撑 Azure AI 基础设施\n\n**PX58** · NVIDIA → Alphabet / Google\nNVIDIA GPU 支撑 Google Cloud AI 基础设施",
      "color": "#334155"
    },
    {
      "id": "24f6be71530c790b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 2420,
